Full license texts for third-party components distributed with VesperApp.
The component-to-license mapping is in ../THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md (regenerate it when adding a dependency).

Files:
- MIT.txt                        MIT template (copyright holders per component in the notices file)
- Apache-2.0.txt                 Apache License 2.0 (canonical text)
- PortAudioSharp2-LICENSE.txt    PortAudioSharp2 binding (Apache-2.0, Copyright 2019 Benjamin N. Summerton)
- PortAudio-LICENSE.txt          PortAudio native library (PortAudio license, Ross Bencina and Phil Burk)
- ANGLE-BSD-3-Clause.txt         ANGLE (Avalonia.Angle.Windows.Natives)
- MS-PL.txt                      Microsoft Public License (Svg.Custom)
- Fizzler-LGPL-3.0.txt           Fizzler (via Markdown.Avalonia.Html)
- FTD2XX.Net-LICENSE.txt         FTDI FTD2XX_NET.dll licence
Also at the repository root: libusb-LICENSE.txt (LGPL-2.1), LibUsbDotNet-LICENSE.txt (LGPL-3.0), LICENSE (VesperApp, LGPL-3.0).
